---
name: sweep-stale-branches
description: Delete the branches nobody is working on, so the branch list stays readable.
akb:
  hook: schedule
  i18n:
    zh:
      title: Sweep stale branches
---

Delete the branches nobody is working on, so the branch list stays readable.

## Process

1. List the branches merged into `main` more than 30 days ago.
2. Delete each one, and say which in the run's last message.

